# Files that run inside the Linux containers keep LF line endings on every
# checkout. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which turned
# "#!/bin/bash" into "#!/bin/bash\r" and crash-looped the backend and the
# workspace-worker (issue #818). Only these patterns are pinned: a blanket
# "* text=auto" would renormalise files git misdetects as text.
*.sh         text eol=lf
*.py         text eol=lf
Dockerfile*  text eol=lf
Makefile     text eol=lf
*.yml        text eol=lf
*.yaml       text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
envs/*       text eol=lf
